device identifiers or calibration data are distributed by this repository.

Generic Samsung DTBH/Android-v0 packing helpers in scripts/boot/ are reused
from TurboCE/galaxy-s9plus-ubuntu commit
9a15fe0f75669779eb3ee460eccbde229167b248 (GPL-2.0-only), derived from the
SheroAbi/galaxy-s9plus-mainline-linux project and dtbtool-exynos work credited
there. Only source-format helpers are reused; no G965N image, device tree or
